  "title": "Shared Blood",
  "notes": "**THE VALLEY v4.18.1** \u2014 Ionity Global (Pty) Ltd\n\n- **No more hanging cliff rocks:** before a rock is placed on a terrain wall, the ground under its whole footprint is checked. No rock hangs over a lower step or sticks out far past its wall any more.\n- **Line of sight for enemies:** archers and casters no longer shoot or cast through walls, cliffs or buildings. If they can't see you, they move in until they can. The flame ring also needs a clear line.\n- **No more walking on air:**\n  - You can no longer stand on the very corner of a terrace step with your body over the drop. You still step up anything to 55 cm.\n  - Your feet now sit properly on slopes.\n  - Creeps and beasts step down off ledges instead of hovering on the edge.\n  - Other players are no longer predicted upward into the air. When they walk, their feet are placed on the ground.\n- **Paladin tooltips updated:**\n  - Judgment: 1.5 sec stun, interrupt, +20% damage taken, 10 sec cooldown.\n  - Crusader Strike: 15% chance to strike again, up to 3 extra strikes.\n",
  "released": "2026-10-29T19:15:35Z",
